 src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176190/extras/minigames_may30.gif?t=1749479064\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chat up customers from all walks of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176190/extras/stream_characters.png?t=1749479064\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw inspiration from your daily interactions with your clientele to write your latest poem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176190/extras/enhanced_poetry.gif?t=1749479064\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your  choices matter! Choose wisely and see all multiple endings!\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What to Expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About 2 hours of gameplay.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully voiced acted.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several minigames.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176190/extras/steam_poem_2.gif?t=1749479064\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by our personal experiences with local tea shops across the United Kingdom, as well as countless wholesome interactions with kind and wise role models in our lives, this heartfelt visual novel tells a side less told, of a life well lived, and a youth come and gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176190/extras/banner_2.png?t=1749479064\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sips and Sonnets is brought to you by Blue Tan